  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Followup Pskov Forest ph2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppf&#xF6;lj skog Pskov fas 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xE4;r en forts&#xE4;ttning (fas 2) av Sidas uppf&#xF6;ljning av &quot;Modellskog f&#xF6;r h&#xE5;llbart skogsbruk i Pskov&quot;, beslutsnr 4/00, som implementeras av WWF Tyskland. Uppf&#xF6;ljningen, som utf&#xF6;rs av Sidas huskonsult KB Forestry Consulting AB, Kurt Bostr&#xF6;m, omfattar deltagande i styrgruppsm&#xF6;ten och rapportgranskning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a continuation (phase 2) of Sida&apos;s follow-up of &quot;Pskov Model Forest Project&quot;, decision no 4/00, which is implemented by WWF Germany. The follow-up, performed by Sida&apos;s in-house consultant, KB Forestry Consulting AB, Mr Kurt Bostr&#xF6;m, comprises participation in steering committee meetings and reviewing of reports.</narrative>
  </description>
